{"id":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q008","title":"第8題","version":"5","batch":"115-1-med1","sourceSha256":"3fababcd96c16678e5025cfc8c0403228a6363f59b0460652c06ee9fd1615a62","sourceLibraryId":"libfile_6c3d667090188191a22860b2d0d26d36","sourceAnchor":"MOEX-115020-1301-Q008","shortHtml":"<div><p>既有題庫解析（作者未另標示）</p><div><div><div><div><div><p>淚腺窩位於眼眶外上方的額骨，屬眼眶上外側壁，不在眼眶內側壁。因此B最不恰當。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>","html":"<div><div><h2>第8題</h2><p class=\"reviewed-official-answer\"><b>原題答案：</b>B</p></div><div><div><div><div><p>閱讀詳解</p><div><div><div><div><p>眼眶前方的淚腺位於眶頂前外側的淚腺窩；眶內側壁不是它的位置，所以 B 最不恰當。注意不要和前內側壁的淚囊窩混淆。其餘標誌按骨性位置判讀：滑車凹／滑車窩在額骨眶面前內側，眶上孔在額骨眶上緣，視神經管位於蝶骨小翼根部。</p><div><div><div><div class=\"reviewed-figure-group\"><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:550px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.0617760617760619\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/f217de4ef9c45e3707441ab69fff736f5361c7a9037e1b71d6252c7193791064.png\" alt=\"眶頂的淚腺窩\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"550\" height=\"518\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/f217de4ef9c45e3707441ab69fff736f5361c7a9037e1b71d6252c7193791064.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>眶頂的淚腺窩</p><p>先在圖右側找 Lacrimal fossa（淚腺窩）字樣，對應額骨眶面的前外側凹陷；這張眶頂圖沒有同時呈現前內側淚囊窩。</p><details><summary>來源</summary><p>Henry Vandyke Carter, Gray’s Anatomy, 20th edition (1918), via Wikimedia Commons. · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray135.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">圖片來源</a> · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain / PD-scan</a> · 原圖像素未改動；另附中文圖說。</p><ul><li>與下一張前內側圖互補，不能說同一圖包含兩個窩。</li></ul></details></figcaption></figure><figure><div><span class=\"reviewed-image-frame\" data-image-state=\"loading\" style=\"--reviewed-image-width:650px;--reviewed-image-ratio:1.3948497854077253\"><img src=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d5c68cc65bfbed2173be6b104a25af26b6831f820815fdffe6411cfe1ff347cf.png\" alt=\"前內側眶壁與淚囊窩\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"650\" height=\"466\"></span><a class=\"reviewed-image-link\" href=\"/reviewed-explanations/assets/d5c68cc65bfbed2173be6b104a25af26b6831f820815fdffe6411cfe1ff347cf.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">放大查看原圖</a></div><figcaption><p>前內側眶壁與淚囊窩</p><p>沿圖左側 Fossa for lacrimal sac（淚囊窩）的引線找到眶前內側凹窩，再對照下方標為 Maxilla 的上頜骨。原圖未另標上頷骨額突，相關名稱仍須配合正文。</p><details><summary>來源</summary><p>Henry Vandyke Carter, Gray’s Anatomy, 20th edition (1918), via Wikimedia Commons. · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray192.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">圖片來源</a> · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain / PD-scan</a> · 原圖像素未改動；另附中文圖說。</p><ul><li>前內側局部視角；不顯示眶頂淚腺窩。</li></ul></details></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><h3>選項辨析</h3><dl><dt>A</dt><dd><span>A滑車凹位於額骨眶部前內側，正確。</span></dd><dt>B</dt><dd><span>B錯：淚腺窩在眶頂前外側，不在內側壁。前內側的淚囊窩則由前方上頜骨額突與後方淚骨共同界定。</span></dd><dt>C</dt><dd><span>C眶上孔/切跡在額骨，正確。</span></dd><dt>D</dt><dd><span>D視神經管位於蝶骨小翼根部，正確。</span></dd></dl></div><div><h3><span>若題目問淚囊所在的淚囊窩，應往眶的哪一側找？</span></h3><div><div><div><div><div><p>眶內側壁前部；淚腺窩則在眶頂前外側，兩者方向相反。</p></div></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><div><p>用鼻側／顳側定位，可避免將淚腺窩與淚囊窩互換。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><h3>用前內側與前外側辨認兩個「淚」窩</h3><p>淚腺是製造淚液的腺體，位於眶頂前外側的額骨淚腺窩；淚囊是收集淚液、銜接鼻淚管的構造，位於眶內側壁前部的淚囊窩。淚囊窩的前界是上頜骨額突及前淚嵴，後界是淚骨與後淚嵴。兩者名稱接近，但功能、骨性位置都不同。</p><p>滑車小窩也在額骨眶面，卻是前內側，供上斜肌肌腱的滑車固定；淚腺窩則是前外側。眶上孔（部分人為眶上切跡）位在額骨眶上緣，通過眶上神經與血管。視神經管在蝶骨小翼與蝶骨體相接附近，傳視神經（II）及眼動脈。</p><p>常一起考：鼻淚管開口在下鼻道；淚液從眶前外側製造後，經眼表到內側淚點、淚小管、淚囊，再由鼻淚管進入鼻腔。眼眶內側的篩骨紙板很薄；眶底主要由上頜骨形成，也是上頜竇頂壁，與眶頂的淚腺窩不同。</p></div><details><summary>來源</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/books/NBK531490/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anatomy, Head and Neck, Orbit Bones – StatPearls, NCBI Bookshelf</a><p>核對眶頂前外側淚腺窩、前內側滑車窩、眶上孔、視神經管以及眶壁與鼻淚管的解剖。</p></li><li><a href=\"https://surgeryreference.aofoundation.org/cmf/further-reading/bony-anatomy-of-the-orbit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bony anatomy of the orbit — AO Surgery Reference</a><p>AO骨性解剖明確區分前內側淚囊窩（上頜骨額突與淚骨）和前外側淚腺窩；另核滑車、眶頂及眶尖。AO圖片未取得再利用授權，未嵌入。</p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://wwwq.moex.gov.tw/exam/wHandExamQandA_File.ashx?c=301&amp;code=115020&amp;q=1&amp;s=0101&amp;t=Q\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">考選部原卷</a>。核對日期：2026-10-14。各圖作者、原圖連結與授權見圖下「來源」。</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray135.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">圖片來源</a></li><li><a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public domain / PD-scan</a></li><li><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gray192.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">圖片來源</a></li></ul></details></div></div></div>","imageCount":2,"sourceAnswer":"原題答案：B"}